<title>UK: LG Electronics sets $75 mln exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>LG Electronics sets $75 mln exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers UBS (East Asia) and LG Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LG ELECTRONICS INC</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON  ** 0.25-0.5  MATURITY	   2007</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    LUX	 PRICING     24.JUN.97</p>
<p>IND PREM **10-15 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES    **INDICATED. THERE IS A PUT OPTION.</p>
<p>		EXCHANGEABLE INTO COMMON SHARES OF</p>
<p>		LG SEMICON CO LTD (corrects from LG Securities)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
